     /// Plays a track or a context, wherever `playbackDevice` says. A row in a list passes its
     /// index and its track, which the device starts at.
+    ///
+    /// The index goes only without a track. It counts the app's list, which can disagree with the
+    /// context the device resolves: Favorites drops relinked duplicates and rows it cannot read,
+    /// a playlist drops items that are not tracks, and Spotify's generated playlists change under
